<title>USA: Ascend buys StonyBrook Services.</title>
<headline>Ascend buys StonyBrook Services.</headline>
<dateline>ALAMEDA, Calif. 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ascend Communications Inc said Monday it had acquired StonyBrook Services Inc in exchange for 480,000 shares of Ascend.</p>
<p>The transaction will be accounted for as a pooling of interests and is immaterial for financial accounting purposes, Ascend said.</p>
</text>
